WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.540
Took a loss and want it back right now? That's where it gets expensive.

00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:10.350
Revenge trading: trading out of anger.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:15.150
Step one: your mind wants revenge, not analysis.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:19.480
Step two: double the lot size, no setup.

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:24.460
Step three: take a break, only trade setups from your plan.

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:27.960
Remember: the market owes you nothing.

00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:31.640
No time to analyze the market yourself?

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:37.280
I share planned setups live in my free group. Comment GOLD.
